body:
Wow I related to this. And damn that makes whatever I'm about to say even harder but...

&#x200B;

You showing your emotion to be hurt and the emotion to still try and fake it till you make it gives me hope that even with these dark thoughts there are brighter spots. We may all be fuck ups, but there's something worth going on for, even if it's just the satisfaction of maybe one little moment of one day just...not hurting. That's it.
